{"id":"0471e9434da6820e","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-gap-glut-duality.md","title":"双重否定闭包下的gap与glut对称性","display":"lem-gap-glut-duality — 双重否定闭包下的gap与glut对称性","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-gap-glut-duality","aliases":["91-lem-gap-glut-duality","91-lem-gap-glut-relation","91-lem-truth-gap-glut"],"display":"lem-gap-glut-duality — 双重否定闭包下的gap与glut对称性","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-value-gap]]","[[91-df-truth-value-glut]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-gap-glut-duality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-gap-glut-duality</span><span>91-lem-gap-glut-relation</span><span>91-lem-truth-gap-glut</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gap-glut-duality — 双重否定闭包下的gap与glut对称性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8747011468390705\" href=\"?note=8747011468390705\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-gap\">91-df-truth-value-gap</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"73cb2f85d7abd7df\" href=\"?note=73cb2f85d7abd7df\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-glut\">91-df-truth-value-glut</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-gap-glut-duality-—-双重否定闭包下的-gap-与-glut-对称性\">lem-gap-glut-duality — 双重否定闭包下的 gap 与 glut 对称性</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Code}_{T}\n=\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Code}_{T}\n=\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}\\)</span> (句子编码集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\operatorname{Code}_{T}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\operatorname{Code}_{T}\\)</span> (允许不一致的真信息集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\n=\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\n=\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\)</span> (否定编码函数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gap}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma\n\\land\\operatorname{neg}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\notin\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathrm{Gap}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma\n\\land\\operatorname{neg}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\notin\\Gamma\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Glut}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma\n\\land\\operatorname{neg}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathrm{Glut}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma\n\\land\\operatorname{neg}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\in\\Gamma\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DN}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{neg}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner))\n\\in\\Gamma\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma\n\\bigr)\">\\(\\mathrm{DN}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{neg}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner))\n\\in\\Gamma\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma\n\\bigr)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gap\\text{-}glut\\text{-}duality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DN}(\\Gamma)\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Gap}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Gap}_\\Gamma(\\neg\\varphi)\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Glut}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Glut}_\\Gamma(\\neg\\varphi)\n\\bigr)\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gap\\text{-}glut\\text{-}duality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DN}(\\Gamma)\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Gap}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Gap}_\\Gamma(\\neg\\varphi)\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Glut}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Glut}_\\Gamma(\\neg\\varphi)\n\\bigr)\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里用同一签名信息集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 同时表示正、负信息：\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的负信息就是\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。把\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\)</span> 代入 gap 或 glut 定义会出现双重否定编码；双重否定\n闭包正好把它换回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>。这说明的是每一类在否定下对称，\n并不是 gap 与 glut 彼此等价。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 一致，即没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi,\\neg\\varphi\\)</span> 同时属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>，\n则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Glut}_\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathrm{Glut}_\\Gamma\\)</span> 为空。从空信息生成的强 Kleene 固定点保持\n一致；在完整幂集上的代数固定点讨论中则必须另行说明是否允许 glut。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-gap-glut-duality-—-双重否定闭包下的-gap-与-glut-对称性","text":"lem-gap-glut-duality — 双重否定闭包下的 gap 与 glut 对称性","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-value-gap","status":"resolved","id":"8747